The CFR Cluj 1907 app makes it easier for fans to stay in touch with their favorite team. You get exclusive content, fresh news, higlights and articles with just one touch.
A set of features enrich your experience:
- 360° view of the stadium;
- ranking and the matches schedule;
- premium account connected to the Facebook profile;
- photo gallery from each match;
- possibility to vote individual players in real time;
- information about players, coach and staff members.
